  "method": "One warmup per variant/profile, then 6 repetitions x 3 rotating variants x 2 profiles (36 samples, 42 builds/executions). Fresh scalar/nominal/struct workspaces each time; identical scalar/nominal source. Explicit GC and MemStats snapshots outside time window; GC remains enabled inside. check_ns covers workspace load/lock plus analysis and one verified MIR lowering; nominal additionally includes test-owned annotation and validation. native_ns covers normal C emission/tool discovery/MSVC compile/link/artifact reading. total_ns continuously spans both phases plus entry selection, excluding workspace setup, final user EXE write and execution. go_alloc_bytes and go_mallocs are cumulative Go process allocations over that window, not peak/RSS or MSVC/linker child allocations. Ambient OS/tool caches; in-process harness, no compiler-process startup. Extra C inspection and correctness execution outside measurement. No nominal source parser, runtime benchmark, Linux, cache or debug-size claim; no PDB requested.",
